{"Title":"An Act to protect Norwood healthcare access","BillNumber":"S2979","DocketNumber":"SD3470","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MFR0","Name":"Michael F. Rush","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MFR0","ResponseDate":"2024-10-07T13:26:01.613"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MFR0","Name":"Michael F. Rush","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MFR0","ResponseDate":"2024-10-07T13:26:01.6133333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2979/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Rush, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 2979) (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Michael F. Rush for legislation to protect Norwood healthcare access.  Health Care Financing.","DocumentText":"\tNotwithstanding any general or special law or any provision of chapter 111 of the general laws or any regulation promulgated thereunder to the contrary, the department, as defined under section 1 of said chapter 111, is hereby authorized and directed to continue, extend, or otherwise empower to remain in full force department license number 2114, issued by said department November 6, 2022, in order to maintain the provision of health care services, including, but not limited to, the provision of chemotherapy, radiation, radiology, and other forms of life-saving health care and therapies and studies, that are provided, as of the date of this act, in the towns of Norwood and Foxborough in department facilities 21PH, known as Norwood Hospital Cancer Center, 22LD, known as Norwood Performance Therapy, 299F, known as Foxboro, and any other such facilities operating under said license.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to protect access to healthcare, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public health.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Discharge to Another Committee","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J16","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J16"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}